• INTENDED USERS OF THE SOFTWARE
SceneGraphManager is a JSON-driven AI workflow engine designed to orchestrate multi-agent systems using LangGraph. The Software provides workflow management, model integration (Anthropic, OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, Ollama), MCP (Model Context Protocol) integration, A2A (Agent-to-Agent) protocol support, and advanced state management capabilities.

